# Akron perf harness scenario: deterministic movement loop.
# Played through CelesteTAS (akron_tas_file + akron_play_tas). There is no
# `console load` line on purpose: playback starts from whatever room the
# driver already put the player in, so the same file is reusable and the
# measured frames are always in-room gameplay frames.
# The right and left halves are frame-symmetric, so the player oscillates
# around its start position instead of walking out of the room. That keeps
# every StartPos slot-count variation comparable.
# Cycle = 130 frames, 12 cycles = 1560 frames (~26s at 60fps).

RecordCount: 0

